            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "26-1. MEETINGS: Association- Board Athletic Committee—The Board and the Association agree that, in order to achieve a more flexible and meaningful athletic program, members of the Board of Education's Athletic Committee will meet with representatives of the Association no less than three (3) times per year, (at least two (2) of these meetings shall be before January 1 of each school year), for purposes of discussing and planning activities of mutual concern.",
